								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1.0">General Discussion</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.150#msg16008">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: March 30, 2005, 03:30:08 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I ~almost~ changed my underguild comment of longest elemental guild not in time but i noticed right before that I said actively raiding[and radiant had a serious lull].  <br /><br />A backgrounder.  Radiant was ahead of Moonlight Crusaders once upon a time.  Entered elemental planes noticably ahead of MC.  In fact when I first joined my current guild over a year ago I got two of my pre-elemental flags on xflags with radiant.  So they were hopping.  But then sort of dried up... Ok so I looked them up for this post.  They are in a pre-elemental/early elemental rebuilding phase it looks like.<br /><br /><a href="http://www.radiantguild.org/" target="_blank">http://www.radiantguild.org/</a><br /><br /></td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td colspan="3" class="windowbg2" align="right">
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
